Blake Lively has added Nick Shapiro, a former CIA official, to her litigation team to advise on legal communications, Lively’s lawyers confirmed to Forbes, as her ongoing legal feud with “It Ends With Us” director and co-star Justin Baldoni continues, months after both actors filed dueling lawsuits.
